# Records assets/demo.gif. Needs vhs and ttyd (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs).
# Run from the repo root: vhs assets/demo.tape

Output assets/demo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1000
Set Height 400
Set Padding 20
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type 'opencode run "explain in plain english what a database index is, in one sentence"'
Enter
Sleep 15s
